T1  - An atomic layer deposition diffusion–reaction model for porous media with different particle geometries
PY  - 2024
Y1  - 2024/03/07
DO  - 10.1039/d3cp05639b
JO  - Physical Chemistry Chemical Physics
JA  - Phys. Chem. Chem. Phys.
VL  - 26
